{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left\">美國移民執法人員近日在紐約向司機開槍，當時車內有一名男童，當局指涉事男子試圖駕車撞向執法人員。紐約市長曼達尼更呼籲廢除相關部門。</p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\">紐約警方公開事發片段，當時汽車準備離開現場，至少兩名執法人員向車開槍。另一片段看到涉事汽車被截停，一名男子受傷坐在地上，雙手放在背後，紐約警方將他抬上警車，送院救治。</p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"\n  margin: 0 0 4px 0; \n  border-radius: 8px; \n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid #e4e7ed;\n\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.US.ICE-0600_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20260eY7XVpAo91791587669.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"\n        width: 100%; \n        max-width: 100%; \n        height: auto;\n        border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; \n        display: block;\n        object-fit: contain;\n      \" title=\"Picture_J.US.ICE-0600_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\">國土安全部長穆林指，多明尼加籍28歲涉案男子貝爾加爾屢次犯案，試圖逃避警方追捕。穆林強調，移民及海關執法局特工當時不知道有男童在車內，他沒有受傷。紐約市長曼達尼譴責事件，打算要求總統特朗普暫停移民部門在紐約市執法。他更在網上發文，呼籲廢除移民及海關執法局。</p><p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"\n  margin: 0 0 4px 0; \n  border-radius: 8px; \n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid #e4e7ed;\n\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.US.ICE-0600_002.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Okf8Uqq9FZ1791587666.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"\n        width: 100%; \n        max-width: 100%; \n        height: auto;\n        border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; \n        display: block;\n        object-fit: contain;\n      \" title=\"Picture_J.US.ICE-0600_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-09T23:58:18.016730+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":277,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}